{"page":76,"verses":[{"verse_key":"3:195","surah":3,"ayah":195,"ar_uthmani":"فَٱسْتَجَابَ لَهُمْ رَبُّهُمْ أَنِّى لَآ أُضِيعُ عَمَلَ عَـٰمِلٍ مِّنكُم مِّن ذَكَرٍ أَوْ أُنثَىٰ ۖ بَعْضُكُم مِّنۢ بَعْضٍ ۖ فَٱلَّذِينَ هَاجَرُوا۟ وَأُخْرِجُوا۟ مِن دِيَـٰرِهِمْ وَأُوذُوا۟ فِى سَبِيلِى وَقَـٰتَلُوا۟ وَقُتِلُوا۟ لَأُكَفِّرَنَّ عَنْهُمْ سَيِّـَٔاتِهِمْ وَلَأُدْخِلَنَّهُمْ جَنَّـٰتٍ تَجْرِى مِن تَحْتِهَا ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ ثَوَابًا مِّنْ عِندِ ٱللَّهِ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ عِندَهُۥ حُسْنُ ٱلثَّوَابِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Their Lord has answered them: ‘I will not allow the deeds of any one of you to be lost, whether you are male or female, each is like the other [in rewards]. I will certainly wipe out the bad deeds of those who emigrated and were driven out of their homes, who suffered harm for My cause, who fought and were killed. I will certainly admit them to Gardens graced with flowing streams, as a reward from God: the best reward is with God.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَٱسْتَجَابَ","en_gloss":"Then responded","transliteration":"fa-is'tajāba","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رَبُّهُمْ","en_gloss":"their Lord","transliteration":"rabbuhum","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَنِّى","en_gloss":"Indeed, I","transliteration":"annī","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَآ","en_gloss":"(will) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أُضِيعُ","en_gloss":"(let go) waste","transliteration":"uḍīʿu","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَمَلَ","en_gloss":"deeds","transliteration":"ʿamala","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَـٰمِلٍۢ","en_gloss":"(of the) doer","transliteration":"ʿāmilin","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِّنكُم","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"[from]","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ذَكَرٍ","en_gloss":"(whether) male","transliteration":"dhakarin","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أُنثَىٰ ۖ","en_gloss":"female","transliteration":"unthā","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بَعْضُكُم","en_gloss":"each of you","transliteration":"baʿḍukum","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِّنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بَعْضٍۢ ۖ","en_gloss":"(the) other","transliteration":"baʿḍin","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":17,"ar":"فَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"So those who","transliteration":"fa-alladhīna","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":18,"ar":"هَاجَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"emigrated","transliteration":"hājarū","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَأُخْرِجُوا۟","en_gloss":"and were driven out","transliteration":"wa-ukh'rijū","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":20,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":21,"ar":"دِيَـٰرِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their homes","transliteration":"diyārihim","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":22,"ar":"وَأُوذُوا۟","en_gloss":"and were harmed","transliteration":"waūdhū","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":23,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":24,"ar":"سَبِيلِى","en_gloss":"My way","transliteration":"sabīlī","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":25,"ar":"وَقَـٰتَلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and fought","transliteration":"waqātalū","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":26,"ar":"وَقُتِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and were killed ","transliteration":"waqutilū","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":27,"ar":"لَأُكَفِّرَنَّ","en_gloss":"surely I (will) remove","transliteration":"la-ukaffiranna","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":28,"ar":"عَنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"from them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":29,"ar":"سَيِّـَٔاتِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their evil deeds","transliteration":"sayyiātihim","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":30,"ar":"وَلَأُدْخِلَنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"and surely I will admit them","transliteration":"wala-ud'khilannahum","verse_key":"3:195"},{"pos":31,"ar":"جَنَّـٰتٍۢ","en_glo