":"وَإِنَّ مِنْ أَهْلِ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ لَمَن يُؤْمِنُ بِٱللَّهِ وَمَآ أُنزِلَ إِلَيْكُمْ وَمَآ أُنزِلَ إِلَيْهِمْ خَـٰشِعِينَ لِلَّهِ لَا يَشْتَرُونَ بِـَٔايَـٰتِ ٱللَّهِ ثَمَنًا قَلِيلًا ۗ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ لَهُمْ أَجْرُهُمْ عِندَ رَبِّهِمْ ۗ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ سَرِيعُ ٱلْحِسَابِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Some of the People of the Book believe in God, in what has been sent down to you and in what was sent down to them: humbling themselves before God, they would never sell God’s revelation for a small price. These people will have their rewards with their Lord: God is swift in reckoning.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"3:199"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"3:199"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَهْلِ","en_gloss":"(the) People","transliteration":"ahli","verse_key":"3:199"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"3:199"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَمَن","en_gloss":"(are those) who","transliteration":"laman","verse_key":"3:199"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minu","verse_key":"3:199"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"3:199"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"3:199"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أُنزِلَ","en_gloss":"was revealed","transliteration":"unzila","verse_key":"3:199"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilaykum","verse_key":"3:199"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"3:199"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أُنزِلَ","en_gloss":"was revealed","transliteration":"unzila","verse_key":"3:199"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"to them ","transliteration":"ilayhim","verse_key":"3:199"},{"pos":14,"ar":"خَـٰشِعِينَ","en_gloss":"humbly submissive","transliteration":"khāshiʿīna","verse_key":"3:199"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"to A